areas of the Donetsk and Luhansk oblasts of Ukraine, and ordered the Russian armed forces into those areas. On 24 Feb 2022, he ordered a military operation in Ukraine and Russian armed forces began an attack on Ukraine. That attack is a blatant violation of the territorial integrity, sovereignty and independence of Ukraine. Vladimir Putin is responsible for and actively supporting actions undermining the territorial integrity, sovereignty and independence of Ukraine, as well as stability and security in Ukraine.", "The Director Disqualification Sanction was imposed on 09/04/2025.", "Function: President of the Russian Federation"], "title": ["His Excellency"], "gender": ["male"], "topics": ["corp.disqual", "sanction", "wanted", "export.control", "role.pol", "debarment", "poi", "role.rca", "role.pep"], "address": ["Moscow", "Bocharov Ruchey, Sochi", "Bocharov Ruchey Sochi Russia", "Novo-Ogaryevo, Moscow Region", "Kremlin Moscow Russia", "Moscow, Russia", "Novo-Ogaryevo Moscow Region Russia", "Valdai Novgorod Region Russia", "Kremlin, Moscow", "Valdai, Novgorod Region"], "country": ["ru"], "website": ["http://putin.kremlin.ru/"], "lastName": ["Putin", "?????", "PUTIN", "??????", "POUTINE"], "position": ["President of the Russian Federation", "chairperson", "président de la Fédération de Russie", "Supreme Commander-in-Chief of the Armed Forces of the Russian Federation (2012-)", "chairperson (2012-)", "party leader (1995-1997)", "Chairman of the Council of CIS Heads of State (2004-2006)", "President", "Chairman of the Commission on Military-Technical Cooperation of the russian federation with foreign countries", "Prime Minister of Russia (2008-2012)", "Secretary of the Security Council of Russia (1999-1999)", "Chairman of the State Council of the russian federation", "chairman of the military-industrial commission", "Acting President of Russia (1999-2000)", "President of Russia (2012-)", "Prime Minister of Russia (1999-2000)", "Chairman of the Council of CIS Heads of St