?????, ?????????? ?????????? ??? ????????? ????????? ???????, ??????????? ? ??????? ???????. | — ??. 159 ?? ?? «?????????????», ?? ???? ??????? ?????? ????????? ??? ???????????? ????? ?? ????? ????????? ????? ?????? ??? ??????????????? ????????. | — ??. 174 ?? ?? «??????????? (?????????) ???????? ??????? ??? ????? ?????????, ????????????? ??????? ?????? ?????????? ?????», ?? ???? ?????????? ?????????? ???????? ? ?????? ?????? ? ????????? ?????????? ??? ???? ??????????, ???????? ?????????????? ??????? ?????? ?????????? ?????, ? ????? ???????? ???????????? ???? ????????, ??????????? ? ???????????? ?????????? ????????? ?????????? ??? ???? ??????????.", "Victor Vekselberg jest rosyjskim oligarch? i biznesmenem od 2004 r. zamieszka?ym w Zurychu. Maj?tek ww. wyceniony jest na 17,2 miliarda dolarów. Jest prezesem rosyjsko–ameryka?skiej spó?ki Renova, b?d?cej potentatem przemys?u aluminiowego i tytanowego. Prowadzi? równie? dzia?alno?? gospodarcz? na Ukrainie, gdzie zarz?dza? spó?kami dystrybucji gazu. V. Vekselberg ma mie? bliskie powi?zania z prezydentem Rosji W. Putinem i by?ym prezydentem Dmitrijem Miedwiediewem. Stany Zjednoczone uzna?y V. Vekselberga za dzia?aj?cego w imieniu W. Putina i zajmuj?cego pozycj? kluczowego gracza w rosyjskim sektorze technologicznym za po?rednictwem holdingu Renova. Ponadto mia? bra? udzia? w rosyjskich dzia?aniach dyplomatycznych i dzia?aniach o charakterze „soft power” na rzecz Kremla. W efekcie zosta? obj?ty sankcjami USA, w nast?pstwie których m.in. zabezpieczono jacht i samolot o warto?ci ocenionej na 180 milionów dolarów. Wymieniony jest ob?o?ony sankcjami: Ukrainy, Stanów Zjednoczonych Ameryki, Wielkiej Brytanii. Ze wzgl?du na rol? odgrywan? w rosyjskim sektorze przemys?u aluminiowego i tytanowego.", "Disqualified", "Russian–Cypriot oligarch and businessman", "Transport sanctions: ships owned, controlled, chartered or operated by the individual are prohibited from entering a port in the UK; may be given a movement or a port entry direction, can be detained, and will be refused permission to register on the UK Ship Register or have its existing registration terminated. An aircraft owned, chartered or operated by the individual is prohibited from overflying or landing in the UK, may be given a movement direction, can be detained or moved to a specified airport, and will be refused permission to register on the CAA Aircraft Register or have its existing registration terminated. Prohibition of technical assistance relating to aircraft and ships: a prohibition on the provision of technical assistance relating to aircraft or ships will prevent a person from directly or indirectly providing technical assistance to, or for the benefit of, the designated person, where that technical assistance relates to an aircraft or ship. The transport sanctions were imposed on 17/07/2023. The Director Disqualification Sanction was imposed on 09/04/2025."], "phone": ["+7(495) 720 49 499"], "title": ["Mr"], "gender": ["male"], "topics": ["corp.disqual", "sanction", "reg.action", "role.oligarch", "export.control", "debarment", "poi", "role.rca"], "address": ["Russia", "Bakhrushina Str., Apt. 15 19/2, Moscow 115054, Russia", "???????, ????????? ???????, ?. ????????"], "country": ["ru"], "innCode": ["772606188083"], "summary": ["Probable Organizer"], "lastName": ["VEKSELBERG", "???????????", "Vekselberg"], "position": ["???????????? ?????? ?????????? ?????? ???????? «??????»", "???????????", "Chairman of Renova Group", "Chairman of the Board of Directors of the Renova group of companies"], "birthDate": ["1957-04-14"], "createdAt": ["2018-04-06"], "firstName": ["Viktor", "Viktor Felixovich", "Victor", "??????", "Viktor Feliksovich"], "programId": ["NZ-RSA2022", "GB-RUS", "AU-RUSSIA", "CA-SEMA", "UA-SA1644", "US-UKRRUS-REL"], "sourceUrl": ["https://home.treasury.gov/news/press-releases/sm0338", "https://sanctionssearch.ofac.treas.gov/Details.aspx?id=24306", "https://home.treasury.gov/news/press-releases/jy0650", "https://